    "text": "<p>For nucleophile substitution in aromatic halides</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0141_cf1739f860f5.png\" style=\"width: 335px; height: 139px;\" /></p><p>Correct order is:</p><p>(i) &lt; (ii) &lt;&nbsp;(iii) &lt;&nbsp;(iv)</p><p>More No. of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> substituted aromatic halide, increase the rate of nucleophile substitution reaction in aromatic halides.</p>"
